   Let the ratio ratio of the number of atoms be 9:1:3.5.  
   Mass of C = 9 × 12 = 108 g/mol  
   Mass of H = 1 × 1 = 1 g/mol  
   Mass of N = 3.5 × 14 = 49 g/mol  

2. **Total mass of the compound:**  
   Total mass = mass of C + mass of H + mass of N = 108 + 1 + 49 = 158 g/mol.  
