The PW2D/PWP method is a density functional theory (DFT) method that combines the PWP2D method with a partialized-based wavefunction (VBO) approach. It is parameterized to reproduce experimental experimental data for Cu(I) complexes, especially the stability of Cu(I) complexes.

### 2. **Geometry Optimization**
