\]  
where \( \text{PC}_1, \text{PC}_2, \text{CP}_3, \text{PC}_4 \) are the individual transfer factors.  

From the reference document, the measured SRDs (specificed relative doses) for the soil-to-polished rice transfer factor (PF) of \(^{133}\text{Cs}\) are:  
- \( \text{PF} = 1.0 \times 10^{-4} \)  
- \( \text{PF} = 2.0 \times 10^{-4} \)  
- \( \text{PF} = 1.0 \times 10^{-5} \)  
- \( \text{PF} = 1.0 \times 10^{-6} \)  

Substituting these values into the geometric mean formula:  
\[
\text{Geometric Mean} = \sqrt{(1.0 \times 10^{-4}) \times (2.0 \times 10^{-4}) \times (1.0 \times 10^{-5}) \times (1.0 \times 10^{-6})}
\]  
\[
