\[
P_3(x) = \frac{x^6}{12} - \frac{15x^4}{12} + \frac{36x^2}{12} - \frac{1}{12}
\]
\[
P_3(x) = \frac{x^6}{12} - \frac{5x^4}{4} + 3x^2 - \frac{1}{12}
\]

Thus, the Legendre polynomial \( P_3(x) \) is:
