   \[
   (A \leq B) \subset A \quad \text{and} \quad (B \leq A) \subset A
   \]
   Thus, \( B \leq A \leq A \), which implies \( B \leq A \).

4. **Conclusion:**
   \[
   b \leq A \implies B \subseteq A
   \]

Thus, the statement is proven.
