\]

\[
aD_t^q \left( aD_t^p f(t) \right) = aD_t^{p+q} f(t) - \sum_{j=1}^{m} \left[ aD_t^{p-j} f(t) \right]_{t=a} \frac{(t-a)^{-q-j}}{\Gamma(1-q-j)}. \tag{2.126}
\]

The operators commute only if both sums on the right-hand sides of (2.125) and (2.126) vanish. This requires the simultaneous fulfillment of the conditions:

\[
\left[ aD_t^{q-j} f(t) \right]_{t=a} = 0, \quad (j = 1, 2, \ldots, n), \tag{2.128}
\]

