   \[
   \Delta t' = 3 \text{ years}
   \]

3. **Calculate the time interval in the Earth's frame (\( \Delta t \)):**
   \[
   \Delta t = \gamma \Delta t' = 5 \times 3 \text{ years} = 15 \text{ years}
   \]
